| ACC_NO | BALANCE |
|--------|--------:|
| A1     | 1000    |
| A2     | 500     |

```sql
UPDATE ACCOUNT SET BALANCE = BALANCE - 100 WHERE ACC_NO = 'A1';
SAVEPOINT S1;
UPDATE ACCOUNT SET BALANCE = BALANCE + 100 WHERE ACC_NO = 'A2';
ROLLBACK TO S1;
UPDATE ACCOUNT SET BALANCE = BALANCE + 50 WHERE ACC_NO = 'A2';
```

